hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1146","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' bachey ki namaz ( janaza ( nahin padhi jaeygi . na wo kisi ka waris hoga aur na koi uska waris hoga jab tak ke wo paidaish key waqt roey nahin ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees mein log iztirab key shikar huye hain. baaz ney isey abu Zuber sey aur abu Zuber ney Jabir sey aur Jabir ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marfooan riwayat kya hai, aur Ash-as bin sawar aur deegar kaee logon ney abu Zuber sey aur abu Zuber ney Jabir sey moqufan riwayat ki hai, aur Muhammad bin Is-haq ney Ata bin abi Ribah sey aur Ata ney Jabir sey moqufan riwayat ki hai goya moqoof riwayat marfoo riwayat sey ziyada sahih hai, 2- baaz ehle-ilm isi taraf gaey hain, wo kehtey hain ke bachey ki namaz janaza nahin padhi jaeygi. jab tak ke wo paidaish key waqt na roey, yehi Sufiyan Sory aur Shafai ka qol hai."
"1147","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Suhel bin Baiza ki namaz janaza masjid mein padhi. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, 3- Shafai ka bayan hai ke Malik kehtey hain : maiyat par namaz janaza masjid mein nahin padhi jaeygi, 4- Shafai kehtey hain : maiyat par namaz janaza masjid mein padhi ja sakti hai, aur unhoney isi hadees sey daleel pakdii hai."
"1148","mainey Anas bin Malik key sath eik aadmi ki namaze-janaza padhi to wo uskey sar key samney khadey huye. phir log Quraish ki eik aurat ka janaza ley kar aaye aur kaha : abu-Hamza! uski bhi namaz janaza padha diijiye, to wo chaarpaai key beech mein yani aurat ki kamar key samney khadey huye, to un sey Alaa bin Ziyad ney puchha : aap ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko aurat aur mard key janaazey mein isi tarah khadey hotey dekha hai. jaisey aap khadey huye they? to unhoney kaha : haan, aur jab janazey sey farigh huye to kaha is tariqa ko yad kar lo . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas ki ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- aur kaee logon ney bhi hamaam sey usi key misl riwayat ki hai. Wakee ney bhi ye hadees hamaam sey riwayat ki hai, lekin unhen weham huwa hai. unhoney « an ghalib an Anas» kaha hai aur sahih « an abi ghalib » hai, Abdul-Waris bin Saeed aur deegar kaee logon ney abu-Ghalib sey riwayat ki hai jaisey hamaam ki riwayat hai, 3- is bab mein Samra sey bhi riwayat hai, 4- baaz ehle-ilm isi taraf gaey hain. aur yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. faeyda padhi. : is hadees sey malum huwa ke aurat ki namaz janaza ho to Imam uski kamar key paas khada hoga, aur Imam ko mard key sar key bilmuqaabil khada hona chahiye kyonkey Anas bin Malik ney Abdullah bin Umer ka janaza unkey sar key paas hi khadey ho kar padhaya tha aur Alaa bin Ziyad key poochhney par unhoney kaha tha ke mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko aisey hi kartey dekha hai."
"1149","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Usman bin Mazoon ko baghair shaadi ke zindagi guzarney ki ijazat nahin di, agar aap unhen iski ijazat dey detey to hum khassi ho jaatey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1150","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tumhen koi aisa shakhs shaadi ka pegham dey, jiski deen-daari aur akhlaq sey tumhen itminan ho to us sey shaadi kar do. agar aisa nahin karogey to zamin mein fitna aur fasade-azeem barpa hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki is riwayat mein Abdul-Hameed bin Suleman (Alaihissalam) ki mukhalifat ki gaee hai, isey Les bin Saad ney ba-tareeq : (ibne Ajlan an abi Huraira an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) mursalan ( منقطعاً ( riwayat ki hai (yani : ibne Vushema ka zikr nahin kiya hai). 2- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ka kehna hai ke Les ki hadees (qarib tar) hai, unhon (Bukhari) ney Abdul-Hameed ki hadees ko mehfooz shumar nahin kiya. 3- is bab meinAbu Hatim Muzni aur Aaisha Raziallahu anhuma sey hadeesen aai hain."
"1151","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tumharey paas jab koi aisa shakhs (nikah ka pegham ley kar) aaye , jiski Deen daari aur akhlaq sey tum mutmain ho to us sey nikah kar do. agar aisa nahin karogey to zamin mein fitna aur fasad barpa hoga padhi. logon ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! agar is mein kuchh ho? aap ney teen baar yehi farmaya : ''jab tumharey paas koi aisa shakhs aaye jiski deen-daari aur akhlaq sey tum mutmain ho to us sey nikah kar do. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Abu Hatim Muzni ko sharfe-sohbat (izzat ka sath) hasil hai, hum iskey ilawa un ki koi hadees nahin jantey jo unhoney Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki ho."
"1152","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aurat sey nikah uski Deen daari, uskey maal aur uski khoobsurti ki wajeh sey kiya jata hai.  lekin tum dindaar (aurat) sey nikah ko lazim pakad lo padhi. tumharey dono haath khaak aalud hon.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Auf bin Malik, Ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) , Abdullah bin Amr , aur abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallauh anhum) sey hadeesen aai hain."
"1153","Unhoney eik aurat key paas nikah ka pegham bheja , to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum usey dekh lo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- is bab mein Muhammad bin Muslima , Jabir , abu-Humed aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm isi hadees ki taraf gaey hain, wo kehtey hain : isey dekhney mein koi harj nahin jab wo uski koi aisi chiz na dekhey jis ka dekhna haram hai. yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. 4- aur « أحرى أن يؤدم"
"1154","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''haram aur halal (nikah) key darmiyan farq sirf daf bajaney aur aelan karney ka hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Muhammad bin Haatib ki hadees Hasan hai. 2- Muhammad bin Haatib ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko dekha hai, lekin wo kam-sin bachchey they. 3- is bab mein Ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) , Jabir aur Rabee binte Muawwiz (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1155","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''is nikah ka aelan karo, isey masjidon mein karo aur is par daf bajaao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein ye hadees gharib Hasan hai. 2- Esa bin Memun Ansari hadees mein zaeef qarar diye jatey hain. 3- Esa bin Memun jo ibne-Abi Najeeh sey tafseer riwayat kartey hain, bharosemand hain."
"1156","jis raat meri shaadi thi uski subah Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam merey yahaan tashrif laye. aap merey bistar par aisey hi bethey, jaisey tum (Khalid bin zakwaan) merey paas bethey ho. aur chhoti chhoti bachchiyaan daf baja rahi thin aur jo hamarey baap-dada mein sey jange-badar mein shaheed huye they unka marsiya ga rahi thin, yahan tak ke un mein sey eik ney kaha : hamarey darmiyan eik Nabi hai jo un chizon ko janta hai jo kal hongi, to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us sey farmaya : ''ye na keh. wohi keh jo pehley keh rahi thi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1157","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam shaadi karney par jab kisi ko Mubarak-baad detey to farmatey : (بارك الله لك وبارك عليك وجمع بينكما في الخير)''Allah tujhey barkat ata karey, aur tujh par barkat nazil farmaai aur tum dono ko khair par jama karey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai."
"1158","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar tum mein sey koi apni biwi key paas aaye yani us sey sohbat karney ka irada karey aur ye dua padhey : « بسم الله اللهم جنبنا الشيطان وجنب الشيطان ما رزقتنا » ''Allah key naam sey , aey Allah ! to hamein shetan sey mehfooz rakh aur usey bhi shetan sey mehfooz rakh jo to hamein ata karey yani hamari aulad ko.''  to agar Allah ney unkey darmiyan aulad deney ka faisla kiya hoga to shetan usey koi nuqsan nahin pahuncha sakeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1159","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney shawwaal mein mujh sey shaadi ki aur shawwaal hi mein merey sath aap ney shabbe-zufaaf manaai, Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) apney khandan ki aurton ki rukhsati shawwaal mein ki janey ko mustahab samajhti thin. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- isey hum sirf Sauri ki riwayat sey jantey hain, aur Sauri Ismail bin Umayya sey riwayat kartey hain."
"1160","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Abdur-Rehman bin Auf key jism par zardi ka nishan dekha to puchha : ye kya hai? unhoney arz kiya : mainey eik aurat sey khajoor ki eik guthli soney ke iwaz shaadi kar li hai, aap ney farmaya : ''Allah tumhen barkat ata karey, waleema padhi. karo chahey eik hi bakri ka ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood , Aaisha , Jabir aur Zuhair bin Usman (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Ahmed bin Hanbal kehtey hain : guthli bhar soney ka wazan teen dirham aur tihai dirham wazan key barabar hota hai. 4- Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain : paanch dirham aur tihai dirham key wazan key barabar hota hai."
"1161","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Safiya binte Hayi ka waleema Sattu aur khajoor sey kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"1162","Sufiyan sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai, aur kaee logon ney ye hadees ba-tareeq : (ibne Uena, an Zohri , an Anas) riwayat ki hai lekin in logon ney is mein Wayl bin Dawud aur un ke betey ke waaston ka zikr nahin kiya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Sufiyan bin Uena is hadees mein tadlees (khayanat) kartey they. kabhi unhoney is mein (Wayl bin Dawud an Ibneh) ka zikr nahin kiya hai aur kabhi uska zikr kiya hai."
"1163","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''pehley roz ka khana haq hai, doosrey roz ka khana sunnat hai. aur teesrey roz ka khana to mehaz dikhawa aur numaish hai aur jo riyaakaari karega Allah usey uski riyaakaari ki saza dega. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Masood ki hadees ko hum sirf Ziyad bin Abdullah ki riwayat sey marfoo jantey hain. aur Ziyad bin Abdullah bahut ziyada gharib aur munkir hadeesen bayan kartey hain. 2- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko suna ke wo Muhammad bin Aqba sey naqal kar rahey they ke Wakee kehtey hain : Ziyad bin Abdullah is baat sey bahut buland hain ke wo hadees mein jhoot bolen."
"1164","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tumhen dawat di jaey to tum dawat mein aao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Ali , Abu-Hurera , Bara , Anas aur abu-Ayyub (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1165","Abu-Shuaib naami eik shakhs ney apney eik gosht bechne wale ladkey key paas aa kar kaha : tum merey liye khana banao jo paanch aadmiyon key liye kafi ho kyonkey mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key chehrey par bhook ka asar dekha hai, to usney khana tayyar kiya. phir Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko bulaney key liye aadmi bheja. to usney aap ko aur aap key sath jo log bethey they sab ko khaney key liye bulaya, jab Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam (chalney key liye) uthey, to aap key peechhey eik aur shakhs bhi chala aaya, jo aap key sath us waqt nahin tha jab aap ko dawat di gaee thi. jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam darwazey par pahunchey to aap ney sahib-khana sey farmaya : ''humarey sath eik aur shakhs hai jo hamarey sath us waqt nahin tha, jab tum ney dawat di thi, agar tum ijazat do to wo bhi andar aa jaey?''  usney kaha : hamney isey bhi ijazat dey-di, wo bhi andar aa jaey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1166","Mainey eik aurat sey shaadi ki phir main Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir huwa, to aap ney puchha : ''Jabir ! kya tum ney shaadi ki hai?'' mainey kaha : ji haan ki hai, aap ney farmaya : ''kisi kanwari sey ya bewa sey?'' mainey kaha : nahin, ghair kanwari sey. aap ney farmaya : ''kisi  (kanwari) ladki sey shaadi kyon nahin ki, to us sey kheltaa aur wo tujh sey khelti '' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! (merey walid) Abdullah ka intiqal ho gaya hai, aur unhoney saat ya no ladkiyan chhodi hain, main aisi aurat ko biyah kar laya hun jo unki dekh bhaal kar sakey. chunanche aap ney merey liye dua farmaey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Ubai-bin Kaab aur Kaab bin Ajra Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1167","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''wali ke baghair nikah nahin.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Aaisha , ibne-Abbas , Abu-Hurera , Imran bin Husain aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. (abu-Musa Ash-ari ki hadees par Muallif ka mufassal (tafseeli) kalam agley baab (silsile) mein aa raha hai)."
"1168","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jis aurat ney apney wali ki ijazat key baghair nikah kya to uska nikah batil hai, uska nikah batil hai, uska nikah batil hai, agar usney ussey dukhool kar liya hai to uski sharmgaah halal kar leney key iwaz uskey liye mehar hai, aur agar Auliya mein jhagda ho jaey to jiska koi wali na ho uska wali haakim hoga''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- Yahya bin Saeed Ansari, Yahya bin Ayub, Sufiyan Sory, aur kaee huffaze-hadees ney isi tarah ibne-Jurej sey riwayat ki hai, 3- abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ki) pichli ( hadees mein ikhtilaf hai, usey Israel , shareek bin Abdullah , abu Awana , zuhair bin Muawiya aur Qais bin Rabee ney basanad (أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai, 4- aur asbaat bin Muhammad aur Zaid bin Hubab ney basanad ( يونس بن أبي إسحق an أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai, 5- aur abu-Ubaida Haddad ney basanad ( يونس بن أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) isi tarah riwayat ki hai, is mein unhoney Abu-Is'haq key wastey ka zikr nahin kya hai, 6- neez ye hadees Yunus bin abi Is-haq sey bhi riwayat ki gaee hai unhoney basanad (أبي إسحق an أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai, 7- aur Shoba aur Sufiyan Sory basanad (أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai ke '' wali key baghair nikah nahin hai'' , aur Sufiyan Sory key baaz talaamiza ney basanad (سفيان an أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى) riwayat ki hai, lekin ye sahih nahin hai. un logon ki riwayat , jinhoney b-tareeq : ( أبي إسحق an أبي بردة an أبي موسى an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai ke '' wali key baghair nikah nahin '' merey nazdik ziyada sahih hai, kyonkey Abu-Is'haq Sabeei sey un logon ka samaa, mukhtalif oqaat mein hai agar-che Shoba aur Sory Abu-Is'haq sey riwayat karney waley tamam logon sey ziyada pukhta aur mazbut hafizey waley hain phir bhi un logon ( yani Shoba o Sory key ilawa doosrey riwayaton ( ki riwayat ashbah ( qarib tar ( hai. isliye ke Shoba aur Sory dono ney ye hadees Abu-Is'haq sey eik hi majlis mein suni hai, (aur unkey ilawa riwayaton ney mukhtalif oqaat mein) uski daleel Shoba ka ye bayan hai ke mainey Sufiyan Sory ko Abu-Is'haq sey poochhtey suna ke kya aap ney abu-Barda ko kehtey suna hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' wali key baghair nikah nahin?'' to unhoney kaha : haan ( suna hai ). ye is baat ki daleel hai ke Shoba aur Sory ka makhool sey is hadees ka samaa, eik hi waqt mein hai. aur Abu-Is'haq Sabeei sey riwayat karney mein Israel bahut hi Suqa Raavi hain. Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi kehtey hain ke mujh sey Sory ki riwaayaton mein sey jinhen wo Abu-Is'haq sey riwayat kartey hain, koi riwayat nahin chhoti , magar jo chhoti hain wo sirf isliye chhoti hain ke mainey is silsiley mein Israel par bharosa kar liya tha, isliye ke wo Abu-Is'haq ki hadeeson ko b-tareeq atam bayan kartey they. aur is baab mein Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey hadees : '' baghair wali key nikah nahin '' merey nazdik Hasan hai. ye hadees ibne-Jurej ney b-tareeq : (سليمان بن موسى ، an الزهري ، an عروة ، an عائشة ، an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم), padhi. neez usey hujjaaj bin irtaat aur Jaafar bin Rabeea ney bhi b-tareeq : (الزهري ، an عروة ، an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai. neez Zohri ney b-tareeq : (هشام بن عروة ، an أبيه عروة ، an عائشة ، an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) isi key misl riwayat ki hai. baaz muhaddeseen ney Zohri ki riwayat mein) jisey unhoney b-tareeq : (عروة an عائشة an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai) kalam kya hai, ibne-Jurej kehtey hain : phir main Zohri sey mila aur mainey un sey puchha to unhoney uska inkar kya uski wajeh sey un logon ney is hadees ko zaeef qarar diya . Yahya bin Moin kehtey hain ke ibne-Jurej sey is baat ko Ismail bin Ibrahim bin aleh key ilawa kisi aur ney nahin naqal kya hai, Yahya bin moayan kehtey hain : Ismail bin Ibrahim bin Uleh ka samaa, ibne-Jurej sey nahin hai, unhoney apni kitabon ki tas-heeh Abdul-Majeed bin abdul-Azeez bin abi Rawad ki un kitabon sey ki hai jinhen Abdul-Majeed ney ibne-Jurej sey suni hain. Yahya bin Moin ney Ismail bin Ibrahim bin aleh ki riwayat ko jisey unhoney ibne-Jurej sey riwayat ki hai zaeef qarar diya hai. 8- Sahaba kiram mein sey ehle-ilm ka amal is baab mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki hadees « la نكاح إلا"
"1169","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' zina kaar hain wo aurten jo gawahon key baghair khud nikah kar leti hain ''. Yusuf bin Hammad kehtey hain ke Abdul-Aalaa ney is hadees ko kitabut-tafseer mein marfoo bayan kya hai aur kitabut-talaq mein isey unhoney moqufan bayan kya hai, marfoo nahin kya hai."
"1170","Saeed bin abi Aruba ney isi tarah ki hadees bayan ki hai lekin unhoney usey marfoo nahin kya. aur yehi ziyada sahih hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees ghair mehfooz hai, 2- hum kisi ko nahin jantey jisney isey marfoo kya ho siwaye uskey jo abdul-a'alaa sey marvi hai unhoney Saeed bin abi Aruba sey aur Saeed ney Qatada sey marfooan riwayat ki hai, 3- aur Abdul-Aalaa sey Saeed bin abi Aruba key wastey sey ye moqufan bhi marvi hai. aur sahih wo hai jo ibne-Abbas key qol sey marvi hai ke baghair gawah key nikah nahin, khud ibne-Abbas ka qol hai, 4- isi tarah sey aur kaee logon ney bhi Saeed bin abi Aruba sey isi tarah ki riwayat moqufan ki hai, 5- is bab mein Imran bin Husain , Anas aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 6- Sahaba kiram aur Tabe-een waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, ye log kehtey hain ke baghair gawah key nikah durust nahin. pehley key logon mein is silsiley mein koi ikhtilaf nahin tha lekin baad key ehle-ilm mein sey kuch logon ney is mein ikhtilaf kya hai, 7- ehle-ilm mein is silsiley mein ikhtilaf hai jab eik doosrey key baad gawahi dey yani dono b-yak waqt majlis nikah mein hazir na hon to koofa key aksar ehle-ilm ka kehna hai ke nikah usi waqt durust hoga jab aqd nikah key waqt dono gawah eik sath mojud hon, 8- aur baaz ehal Madina ka khayal hai ke jab eik key baad doosrey ko gawah banaya gaya ho to bhi jayez hai jab wo uska aelan kar den . ye Malik bin Anas waghera ka qol hai. isi tarah ki baat Is-haq bin Raahviya ney bhi kahi hai jo ehal Madina ney kahi hai, 9- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke nikah main eik mard aur do aurton ki shahadat jayez hai, ye Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka qol hai."
"1171","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen namaz key tashahud aur hajat key tashahud ko) alag alag ( sikhaya , wo kehtey hain salaat ka tashahud ye hai : التحيات لله والصلوات والطيبات السلام عليك أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله'' tamam zabani , badani aur maali Ibadatein Allah hi key liye hain. aey Nabi : salamti ho aap par aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkaten hon۔ salamti ho hum par aur Allah key nek bandon par. main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key bandey aur uskey Rasool hain'' , aur hajat ka tashahud ye hai : إن الحمد لله نستعينه ونستغفره ونعوذ بالله من شرور أنفسنا وسيئات أعمالنا فمن يهده الله فلا مضل له ومن يضلل فلا هادي له وأشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله'' sab taarifein Allah hi key liye hain, hum usi sey madad chahtey hain aur usi sey maghfirat talab kartey hain, hum apney dilon ki shararaton aur burey aamal sey Allah ki panah maangtey hain, jisey Allah hidayat dedey usey koi gumrah karney wala nahin aur jisey gumrah kar dey , usey koi hidayat deney wala nahin. main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin. main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key bandey aur uskey Rasool hain''. aur phir aap teen aayaten padhtey. Absar (Raavi hadees) kehtey hain : to hamen Sufiyan Sory ney bataya ke wo teeno aayaten ye thi : يا أيها الذين آمنوا اتقوا الله حق تقاته wala تموتن إلا وأنتم مسلمون'' aey eman walo ! Allah sey daro jaisa darney ka haq hai aur haalate-Islam hi mein maro '' ( Aale-Imran : 102), واتقوا الله الذي تساءلون به والأرحام إن الله كان عليكم رقيبا''Allah sey daro, jis key naam sey tum sawal kartey ho aur jis key wastey sey natey jodtey ho, bilashuba Allah tumhara nigehban hai'' (Nisa ( , « يا أيها الذين آمنوا اتقوا الله وقولوا قولا سديدا » '' aey eman walo ! Allah sey daro, aur raast aur pakki baat kaho '' ( Ahzab : ۷۰ ( . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan hai, 2- isey Aamash ney b-tareeq : أبي إسحق an أبي الأحوص an عبد الله an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلمriwayat kya hai. neez usey Shoba ney b-tareeq : أبي إسحق an أبي عبيدة an عبد الله an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم riwayat kya hai, aur ye dono tareeq sahih hain, isliye ke Israel ney dono ko jama kar diya hai, yani (عن أبي إسحق an أبي الأحوص وأبي عبيدة an عبد الله بن Masood (Raziallahu anhu) an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"1172","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aisay sabhi khutbey jis mein tashahud na ho us haath ki tarah hain jis mein kodh ho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"1173","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' shohar wali aurat chahey bewa ho ya mutallaqa ka nikah na kya jaey jab tak ke uski raza-mandi padhi. hasil na kar li jaey, aur kanwari padhi. aurat ka nikah na kya jaey jab tak ke uski ijazat na ley li jaey aur uski ijazat khamoshi hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Umar, ibne-Abbas , Aaisha aur Urs bin Umaira (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, padhi. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke shohar wali ka nikah uski raza-mandi hasil kiye baghair nahin kya jaeyga. agar uskey baap ney uski shaadi uski raza-mandi key baghair kar di aur usey wo napasand ho to tamam ehle-ilm key nazdik wo nikah mansookh ho jaeyga, 4- kanwari ladkiyon key baap un ki shaadi un ki ijazat key baghair kar den to ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai. koofa waghera key aksar ehle-ilm ka khayal hai ke baap agar kanwari ladki ki shaadi uski ijazat key baghair kar dey aur wo baligh ho aur phir wo apney walid ki shaadi par razi na ho to nikah mansookh ho jaeyga 5- aur baaz ehal Madina kehtey hain ke kanwari ki shaadi agar baap ney kar di ho to durust hai bhale hi wo usey napasand ho, ye Malik bin Anas , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka qol hai."
"1174","shohar wali aurat apney aap par apney wali sey ziyada istehqaaq rakhti hai padhi. aur kanwari sey bhi ijazat talab ki jaeygi aur uski ijazat uski khamoshi hai padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Shoba aur Sory ney isey Malik bin Anas sey riwayat kya hai, 3- baaz logon ney baghair wali key nikah key jawaz par isi hadees sey daleel li hai. halanke is hadees mein aisi koi chiz nahin hai jo uski daleel baney . isliye ke ibne-Abbas sey kaee aur turq sey marvi hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' wali key baghair nikah durust nahin ''. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key baad ibne-Abbas ney bhi yehi fatwa diya ke wali key baghair nikah durust nahin, 4- aur الأيم أحق بنفسها من وليها ka matlab aksar ehle-ilm key nazdik ye hai ke wali shohar wali ka nikah uski raza-mandi aur us sey mashwara key baghair na kerey. agar usney aisa kya to Khansa binte khuddam ki hadees ki mutabiq nikah khatm ho jaeyga. unkey walid ney unki shaadi kar di, aur wo shohar deeda aurat thin, unhen ye shaadi napasand hui to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unkey nikah ko fasakh kar diya ."
